{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99621","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99621/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99621/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99621/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99621","id":2687418210,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6gLr9i","number":99621,"title":"Adding a Window node disables the default cursor shape of sibling Control nodes","user":{"login":"cashew-olddew","id":155181921,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT_jYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155181921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew","html_url":"https://github.com/cashew-olddew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2024-11-24T09:25:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-23T15:11:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.3.stable.steam - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nNormally, changing the default cursor shape of a control node will change the cursor shape while hovering that node.\nHowever, adding a Window node to the scene will disable that behavior and hovering any control node will only show the default arrow cursor until clicking the node, after which, the nodes start behaving normally again.\n\nThis seems to be a focus issue, because setting the window to unfocusable will make the mouse cursor transform normally while hovering control nodes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a button to the scene with the `Mouse > Default Cursor Shape` property set to `Pointing Hand`.\n2. Run the game. Hover the button. The cursor should be a pointing hand.\n3. Add a Window node to the scene.\n4. Run the game. Hover the button. The cursor is now the default arrow head.\n5. Click the button. The cursor now transforms into what it is supposed to be: a pointing hand.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17892685/MRP.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99621/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}